.TH xrootd-config 1 "" "XRootD v6.1.1"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
xrootd-config \- Get configuration information to compile programs which use XRootD
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.SY xrootd-config
.RI [ options ]
.YS
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
The
.B xrootd-config
command line utility makes it easier to build applications that use XRootD.

It can print the installation prefix, compiler flags, and plugin version
needed to link against XRootD.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \-\-cflags
Print pre-processor and compiler flags on standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print a usage message on standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-plugin-version
Print plugin version on standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-prefix
Print installation prefix on standard output.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information on standard output.
.BR
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
If
.B xrootd-config
succeeds, it will exit with 0. Otherwise, if an error occurs, it will exit with a non-zero value.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR cmsd(8)
.BR xrootd(8)
